meta {
  name: Get a tracker’s incident-issue settings
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/organizations/{{organization_id}}/automation-connections/:automationConnection_id/incident-tickets
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  automationConnection_id: 
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  For a Linear (and later Jira) connection: whether it opens an issue for every incident, which team or project gets them and which incidents count (`scope`: `all`, `critical` or `monitors`), what resolving an incident does to its issue (`on_resolve`), what closing the issue does to the incident (`on_closed`), whether notes copy both ways, the teams and finished states to choose from, and the last test’s result.

  Scope: `monitoring.read`
}
